    "detailed_description": "You are the ship's cat, responsible for keeping mice off the SS Tritium. Move through the ship exploring the passenger and crew areas. Gain new powers as you progress. Stop the mice from over-running the world's first nuclear powered passenger ship.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/638bd2afc8c0f11fd0456b562f997008.poster.avif?t=1714355004\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/638bd2afc8c0f11fd0456b562f997008.webm?t=1714355004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/638bd2afc8c0f11fd0456b562f997008.mp4?t=1714355004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game is an action walk-em-up that is easy to play. It has a linear story as seen from the cat's point of view. There is some humour, a fair bit of mystery, and a small amount of scariness and horror.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/f325f892827b675315e82ee95882c05b.poster.avif?t=1714355004\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/f325f892827b675315e82ee95882c05b.webm?t=1714355004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/f325f892827b675315e82ee95882c05b.mp4?t=1714355004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go for a swim<br></li><li>Play mini-golf<br></li><li>DIne in the restaurant<br></li><li>Eat mice</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You are the ship's cat, responsible for keeping mice off the SS Tritium. Move through the ship exploring the passenger and crew areas. Gain new powers as you progress. Stop the mice from over-running the world's first nuclear powered passenger ship.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/638bd2afc8c0f11fd0456b562f997008.poster.avif?t=1714355004\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/638bd2afc8c0f11fd0456b562f997008.webm?t=1714355004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/638bd2afc8c0f11fd0456b562f997008.mp4?t=1714355004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game is an action walk-em-up that is easy to play. It has a linear story as seen from the cat's point of view. There is some humour, a fair bit of mystery, and a small amount of scariness and horror.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/f325f892827b675315e82ee95882c05b.poster.avif?t=1714355004\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/f325f892827b675315e82ee95882c05b.webm?t=1714355004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595040/extras/f325f892827b675315e82ee95882c05b.mp4?t=1714355004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go for a swim<br></li><li>Play mini-golf<br></li><li>DIne in the restaurant<br></li><li>Eat mice</li></ul>",
